# Copy to .env.local (never commit .env.local).
# GitHub token: needed ONLY for the contribution graph (GraphQL API needs auth).
# A classic token with no scopes (read-only public data) or a fine-grained token with public access is enough.
# Without it the site works; the contribution block shows an "unavailable" state.
# With it, REST requests (repos, languages) also get a 5000/h rate limit instead of 60/h per IP.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
GITHUB_USERNAME=ruffbuff
